This is the krakensdr_v2-write-a-block package meant as a guide to building
out-of-tree packages. To use the krakensdr_v2 blocks, the Python namespaces
is in 'krakensdr_v2', which is imported as:

    import krakensdr_v2

See the Doxygen documentation for details about the blocks available
in this package. A quick listing of the details can be found in Python
after importing by using:

    help(krakensdr_v2)
